      "pText": "Geo Board is a long play panel in Sand Beige set with pegs, where children stretch string between the pegs to make shapes. It works like the classroom geoboard at a size children can climb on and hang from. A group can stand along it and each make their own pattern, or work together on one picture. It suits ages 5 to 12. The panel is 19'8\" long but only 1'5\" deep, with a safe play area of 23'8\" x 4'5\", so it can line a wall or divide two play zones. Play here builds visual thinking, critical thinking and upper body strength, and children of different abilities can use it side by side. It carries a 3-year warranty. Ask us where it fits."
